{
  "heading": "Dart awaits a real Yon endpoint",
  "summary": "A Dart service receives an HTTPClient with Needs. The empty GreetingSetup uses Tachyon\u2019s default same-origin asynchronous browser transport; the typed Greeting answer is rendered after Yon replies. Credentials are omitted. Cached GETs may use the browser cache, and a successful ClearCache forces revalidation. OverrideSetup shows that a matching custom adapter still wins. This compiled Dart example is qualified in Chromium, Firefox and WebKit; the other compiled language transports and Fake replacement remain pending (ADR 0090).",
